<title>THAILAND: Thai foreign debt $88.6 bln at end-Nov 1996-BOT.</title>
<headline>Thai foreign debt $88.6 bln at end-Nov 1996-BOT.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's total foreign debt at end-November 1996 stood at $88.6 billion versus $81.8 billion at the end of 1995, the central bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The amount was detailed by the Bank of Thailand at a news conference to announce key and leading economic indicator projections for 1996 and 1997.</p>
</text>
